 to sleep

waitForSteamVR (websockets.go) and IsSteamVRConnected (app.go) only ran on
Windows, so on Linux steamvr.status never went false after SteamVR exited:
the stations were never put to sleep and the app never quit. Both now run on
Linux too, on top of the /proc based isProcRunning.

